## 📋 What's the Challenge?

You're given a webpage that displays a block of **JavaScript code**.

The challenge basically says:

> *"Why search for the flag when I can make a bookmarklet to print it for me?"*

The goal is to understand the JavaScript code and **execute it in your browser** to reveal the flag. 🤓

