# 💥 Step 2 — Run the JavaScript

You don't actually need to create a bookmarklet.

The easiest method is to execute the JavaScript using the browser's Developer Console.

### 1️⃣ Open DevTools

Press:

```text
F12
```

or:

```text
Ctrl + Shift + I
```

### 2️⃣ Open the Console

Select:

```text
Console
```

### 3️⃣ Allow Pasting

Modern browsers may display a self-XSS warning when pasting code into the console.

If prompted, **type manually**:

```text
allow pasting
```

and press **Enter**.

> ⚠️ Only do this when you understand and trust the code you're about to execute. Never paste unknown commands into a browser console.

### 4️⃣ Execute the Challenge Code

Copy the JavaScript from the challenge page and paste it into the console.

Press:

```text
Enter
```

The JavaScript executes and should display the decrypted flag in an alert popup. 🎉

