# 🔄 Alternative — Create an Actual Bookmarklet

You can also execute the code as a real bookmarklet.

### Steps

1. Right-click the **Bookmarks Bar**.
2. Select **Add Page** / **Add bookmark**.
3. Set the name to:

```text
flag
```

4. In the URL field, paste the **entire JavaScript code**, including:

```text
javascript:
```

5. Save the bookmark.
6. Return to the challenge page.
7. Click the bookmarklet.

The JavaScript will execute and display the flag.

