# 🧠 What Did We Learn?

| ✅ Good Practice                             | ❌ What Went Wrong                                |
| ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| Keep secrets server-side                    | The flag was sent to the client                  |
| Don't expose decryption keys                | The decryption key was visible                   |
| Don't expose sensitive logic                | The complete decryption algorithm was available  |
| Use proper authentication and authorization | Anyone accessing the page could execute the code |

